{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55589","headline":"颂 · 德韶","name":"颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂下高峰已显扬，般若圆（《五灯会元》作「圜」）通遍十方。\n人天浩浩无差别，法界纵横处处彰。\n（见《景德传灯录》卷二十五、《五灯会元》卷十。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"德韶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55589.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55589","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}